-- Sync the "Kinerja & Akuntabilitas" module back to the production state.
--
-- 20260713_restore_homepage_modules.sql and 20260715_upsert_homepage_modules.sql overwrite
-- module 816 unconditionally with the July 2026 content: SKM/IPAK TW2 (3,97 / 61 responden)
-- and DIPA only through June 2026. tools/restore-local-db.py replays every migration with
-- --reapply, so each local restore replaced the live module with that older copy — the mirror
-- showed scores and budget periods production had already moved past.
--
-- Guarded by the TW2 image path, so production (already TW3) is untouched and a replay is a
-- no-op. Literal HTML split into adjacent string literals; no backreferences, no `$1`, so
-- MySQL 8 and MariaDB treat it identically.
